ind":"announcement","title":"Two new bosses in the SOULLOOP demo. Now in 11 languages.","summary":"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46260655/afa84818976245613943665a10c6980f0438e0eb.gif The demo just got heavier. Two new minibosses now guard the ends of floor 0 and floor 1, and the demo speaks 10 more languages. THE BOILER COLOSSUS The new end of floor 0. A walking boiler with a temper. Vent ring: a burst of steam all around him. Jump it. Tesla arcs: lines of current across the floor. Step off them. Slag lob: molten slag rains on orange rings. Walk out. Boiler rush: he charges down a lane. Get out of it. D","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T16:26:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114029507","verified_at":"2026-10-21T19:47:06Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4959240-1846651706690698","game_id":"steam-4959240","kind":"announcement","title":"SOULLOOP is in Steam Next Fest. The demo is free.","summary":"Hi, DrFi here, the solo dev behind SOULLOOP. I'm playing the free demo live right now on this page. Come say hi in the chat. SOULLOOP is a steampunk boomer shooter where the cards you draft rewrite how your gun works. The demo is free for all of Next Fest. What is in the demo: Three floors of a steam-powered tech base, with a giant mech boss at the bottom. A shotgun or a chaingun, each with its own trick. No cooldowns. A pressure gauge fills when you play well, then you let it all out in one bla","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T15:08:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690698","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4959240-1846018067933649","game_id":"steam-4959240","kind":"announcement","title":"The SOULLOOP demo is out now, free","summary":"The free SOULLOOP demo is live. Grab it from the store page and jump in.What's in the demo: fight down three floors of the Tech Base with the shotgun and the chaingun. After every floor you draft a card, and the cards change how your guns actually fire, not just the numbers. Every gun has a pressure gauge you fill by playing it well, then vent for a big hit. At the bottom, the Baron is waiting.SOULLOOP is also part of Steam Next Fest, October 19-26.If you play it, tell us in the discussions what","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T15:08:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933649","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:33:03Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4959240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:51:45Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:51:45Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4959240":"2026-10-26T05:51:45Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4959240":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:51:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:51:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5219310":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:51:45Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:51:45Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4959240","app_id":4959240,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:11Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"07c96b9fd5ca4adbf5200f8fae7642303803431230a2cf3313b66b367d50b23a","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"A steampunk roguelite FPS with deckbuilding. Draft a card after every floor: your revolver chains lightning, your saw thrower freezes enemies. Combine 